Srosha: Doth not taking the door to ye liking!
Marji: I think its locked...
Srosha: mmmmm, surpose it is. How will thy move from such a conundrum?
Marji: Theres a bat in the gym closet, I could run over there and break the door open with it!
Srosha: Tis thee prepare to face the wrath of her superiors for such a reckless act?
Marji: No... I dunno I give up! You have a better idea?
Srosha: Perhap one must look to thy self, and see the burdens from which thy carry.
Marji: what.
Srosha: Check your pockets.
